%% CI deployment approval and rollback.
sequenceDiagram
actor Developer
participant Git
participant CI
participant Approver
participant Deploy
participant Production
Developer->>Git: Push commit
Git->>CI: Trigger pipeline
activate CI
CI->>CI: Test and scan
CI-->>Approver: Request approval
alt [approved]
Approver-->>CI: Approve
CI->>Deploy: Deploy image
activate Deploy
Deploy->>Production: Roll out
alt [unhealthy]
Production-->>Deploy: Failed health check
Deploy->>Production: Roll back
Deploy-->>CI: Rolled back
else [healthy]
Production-->>Deploy: Healthy
Deploy-->>CI: Succeeded
end
deactivate Deploy
else [rejected]
Approver-->>CI: Reject
end
CI-->>Developer: Pipeline result
deactivate CI
Note over CI,Approver: Human approval required
